| Брокер в databases.yaml и Redis | [`.docs/configuration.md`](../../.docs/configuration.md) |
| Redis, nginx | [`deployment-infra.mdc`](deployment-infra.mdc) |
| Docker, workers в compose | [`docker.mdc`](docker.mdc) |
